            </span>

        </div>


        <div class="about-hero-layout">

            <div class="about-hero-heading">

                <h1>

                    BUILT AROUND
                    <span>IDEAS,</span>

                    BUSINESS
                    <span>AND TECHNOLOGY.</span>

                </h1>

            </div>


            <div class="about-hero-copy">

                <span class="about-eyebrow">
                    WHO WE ARE
                </span>

                <p>

                    M.H.A is a digital studio focused on building
                    websites, software and digital products that solve
                    practical business problems.

                </p>

                <p>

                    We bring together design thinking, software
                    development and business understanding to create
                    digital solutions with a clear purpose.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================================================
     POSITION
========================================================= -->

<section class="about-position">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="section-topline">

            <span>
                01 / OUR POSITION
            </span>

            <span>
                WHAT M.H.A STANDS FOR
            </span>

        </div>


        <div class="about-position-layout reveal">

            <div class="about-position-heading">

                <h2>

                    NOT TECHNOLOGY
                    <span>FOR THE SAKE</span>
                    OF TECHNOLOGY.

                </h2>

            </div>


            <div class="about-position-content">

                <p class="about-lead">

                    A good digital product should make something
                    clearer, faster, easier or more valuable.

                </p>

                <p>

                    That principle shapes how we approach every
                    project. The goal is not simply to build a website
                    or write software. The goal is to understand what
                    the business needs and then use technology to
                    create the right solution.

                </p>

                <p>

                    Sometimes that means a high-quality customer-facing
                    website. Sometimes it means an internal management
                    system. Sometimes it means developing something
                    completely custom.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


