<!-- =========================================================
     PRINCIPLES
========================================================= -->

<section class="about-principles">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="section-topline">

            <span>
                03 / PRINCIPLES
            </span>

            <span>
                HOW WE THINK
            </span>

        </div>


        <div class="about-principles-layout">


            <div class="about-principles-heading reveal">

                <h2>

                    THE STANDARD
                    <span>BEHIND THE WORK.</span>

                </h2>

                <p>

                    The principles we use to guide design,
                    development and decision-making.

                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="about-principles-list">


                <div class="about-principle reveal">

                    <span class="principle-number">
                        01
                    </span>

                    <div>

                        <h3>
                            Purpose before features.
                        </h3>

                        <p>

                            Every feature should exist for a reason.
                            More functionality does not automatically
                            mean a better product.

                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="about-principle reveal">

                    <span class="principle-number">
                        02
                    </span>

                    <div>

                        <h3>
                            Clarity over complexity.
                        </h3>

                        <p>

                            Good systems make difficult things easier
                            to understand and easier to use.

                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="about-principle reveal">

                    <span class="principle-number">
                        03
                    </span>

                    <div>

                        <h3>
                            Quality in the details.
                        </h3>

                        <p>

                            Typography, spacing, interactions,
                            performance and code quality all contribute
                            to the final experience.

                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="about-principle reveal">

                    <span class="principle-number">
                        04
                    </span>

                    <div>

                        <h3>
                            Build for what comes next.
                        </h3>

                        <p>

                            Digital products should be maintainable
                            and capable of evolving as requirements
                            change.

                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


